  "architecture_rules": [
    "PIE apprenticeship remains the sole capability trust and promotion authority.",
    "This curriculum creates no worker, runtime adapter, action authority or professional authority.",
    "Foundry capability knowledge is training/evaluation context until an explicit PIE worker capability is separately allowlisted.",
    "One Foundry capability may train several existing agents; no duplicate agent is created."
